<title>USA: Accustaff approved for NYSE listing.</title>
<headline>Accustaff approved for NYSE listing.</headline>
<dateline>JACKSONVILLE, Fla. 1996-11-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>AccuStaff Inc said on Wednesday that the company had been approved for listing on the New York Stock Exchange.</p>
<p>On Friday, November 15, 1996, AccuStaff's common stock will begin trading on the New York Stock Exchange under the symbol ASI.</p>
<p>AccuStaff is a provider of staffing and outsourcing services.</p>
</text>
